'''The Perfect Cyclone''' (ハリケーンサイクロン, ''Harikēn Saikuron'', '''Hurricane Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] introduced in [[Oncoming Storm (Insane)|Red Sky at Morning]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = The Perfect Cyclone
|image = E 236.png
|first appearance = [[Oncoming Storm (Insane)|Red Sky at Morning]]<br>
'''ZL''': [[Costly Emigration|Sub-chapter 14 - Costly Emigration]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
The Perfect Cyclone has an enormous standing range of 650 but a blind spot of 250 range. However, despite the very obvious weakness, it is almost impossible to get close enough because of its insanely fast attack rate compared to other [[:Category:Long Distance Enemies|Long Distance Enemies]], greatly increasing its DPS even with low attack power for a Cyclone.

