==Trivia==
*The Perfect Cyclone's name and description may be references to ''Dragon Ball Z''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[wikia:dragonball:Cell|Perfect Cell]]: it achieved its final form by consuming other [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s.
**Its name also references the phrase "perfect storm," which originates from the movie ''[[wikipedia:The Perfect Storm (film)|The Perfect Storm]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], its description misspelled "Meteorologists" as "Meteorolo'''i'''gists".
*Contrary to its description, this enemy does not have the knockback ability.
**However, this appears to be a localization oversight, as the Japanese description mentions that its attacks will cease up close.
*The Perfect Cyclone has the longest range of all [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s.
*[[E-792]]'s Japanese description implies that she is The Perfect Cyclone's niece.

